{"cues":[{"start":0.399,"end":2.26,"text":"Die Konjunktion."},{"start":2.879,"end":6.879,"text":"Was ist eine Konjunktion noch einmal? What is a conjunction"},{"start":6.879,"end":8.48,"text":"Again? A conjunction"},{"start":8.48,"end":9.88,"text":"Connects"},{"start":9.88,"end":11.48,"text":"Two sentences."},{"start":11.48,"end":13.48,"text":"Eine Konjunktion verbindet"},{"start":13.48,"end":15.24,"text":"Zwei Sätze."},{"start":15.24,"end":18.24,"text":"Also noch einmal die Konjunktion"},{"start":18.24,"end":19.68,"text":"Sondern."},{"start":19.68,"end":22.68,"text":"Sondern means in Englisch but"},{"start":22.68,"end":25,"text":"This but rather"},{"start":25,"end":27.779,"text":"Or also but instead."},{"start":28.4,"end":34,"text":"Drei wichtige Punkte, three important features. Sondon is used to express a direct"},{"start":34,"end":35.5,"text":"Correction."},{"start":35.559,"end":38.84,"text":"Something is wrong and you want to correct it in the same sentence,"},{"start":38.84,"end":43.66,"text":"Then you can use this sondern and also as an alternative."},{"start":44.2,"end":48,"text":"It follows a negated sentence and very important"},{"start":48,"end":51,"text":"Because can only only use sondon"},{"start":51,"end":54.48,"text":"If the sentence before sondern is negated"},{"start":54.48,"end":58.199,"text":"Which means you either use nicht oder kein oder"},{"start":58.199,"end":60.68,"text":"Nie oder niemand."},{"start":60.68,"end":63.6,"text":"Do examples for all of them. And"},{"start":63.6,"end":66.96,"text":"Position null position zero."},{"start":66.96,"end":69.52,"text":"This is about sentence structure will talk about"},{"start":69.52,"end":71.6,"text":"Just in a second."},{"start":71.6,"end":75.56,"text":"First a very simple example. Was ist das?"},{"start":75.56,"end":78.68,"text":"Ist das eine Banane? Nein. Ist das"},{"start":78.68,"end":80.24,"text":"Eine Kiwi?"},{"start":80.24,"end":81.159,"text":"Nein."},{"start":81.159,"end":83.5,"text":"Ist das ein Apfel?"},{"start":83.56,"end":87.24,"text":"Nein, das ist kein Apfel, sondern eine"},{"start":87.24,"end":88.72,"text":"Birne."},{"start":88.72,"end":92.259,"text":"That's not an Apple. But a pear."},{"start":92.52,"end":96.72,"text":"Das ist kein Apfel, sondern eine Birne."},{"start":96.72,"end":98.479,"text":"So, here we have the first part,"},{"start":98.479,"end":100.72,"text":"First sentence which is"},{"start":100.72,"end":102.36,"text":"Negated statement."},{"start":102.36,"end":107.079,"text":"With kein, but you can also use nicht as mentioned before or nie or"},{"start":107.079,"end":110,"text":"Niemand. In most situations when you use sundon"},{"start":110,"end":112.92,"text":"You will either use nicht oder kein."},{"start":112.92,"end":115.36,"text":"If you're not sure about when to use nicht,"},{"start":115.36,"end":118.6,"text":"The difference between those two have a video linked"},{"start":118.6,"end":120.7,"text":"Down in the description."},{"start":121,"end":124,"text":"And the second part is sondern eine Birne."},{"start":124,"end":125.86,"text":"The correction"},{"start":126.119,"end":128.84,"text":"We have sondern and then eine Birne."},{"start":128.84,"end":131.28,"text":"That is the correction. So you can say"},{"start":131.28,"end":134.04,"text":"Kein Apfel. is not true."},{"start":134.04,"end":136.64,"text":"This is not an apple"},{"start":136.64,"end":141.12,"text":"But a peer. So eine Birne that's the true"},{"start":141.12,"end":144.48,"text":"Correction true fact which is the correction."},{"start":144.48,"end":146.239,"text":"So in other word you can see this"},{"start":146.239,"end":149.519,"text":"Sondon as kind of a scale in the middle"},{"start":149.519,"end":152.239,"text":"Between the negated statement"},{"start":152.239,"end":153.44,"text":"Which is"},{"start":153.44,"end":155.959,"text":"For example a noun or location or verb"},{"start":155.959,"end":158.84,"text":"And then the correct element"},{"start":158.84,"end":162.099,"text":"Which provides the factual correction."},{"start":162.4,"end":167.5,"text":"Sondern ist in between those two kind of balance"},{"start":168.08,"end":171.54,"text":"True and not true one."},{"start":171.76,"end":175.68,"text":"Anderes Beispiel: Derug fährt nicht nach Ulm,"},{"start":175.68,"end":178.019,"text":"Sondern nach Wien."},{"start":178.159,"end":181.4,"text":"Der Zug fährt nicht nach Ulm,"},{"start":181.4,"end":183.76,"text":"Sondern nach Wien."},{"start":183.76,"end":186.68,"text":"The train isn't going to Ulm, but to"},{"start":186.68,"end":188.18,"text":"Vienna."},{"start":189.12,"end":190.4,"text":"Negated"},{"start":190.4,"end":191.48,"text":"Statement"},{"start":191.48,"end":193.9,"text":"Nicht nach Ulm"},{"start":198.04,"end":199.819,"text":"Nach vien"},{"start":201.159,"end":204.56,"text":"Sonder nach vien ist correct"},{"start":204.56,"end":206.58,"text":"Sentence part"},{"start":206.92,"end":211.459,"text":"Which means the correction itself with Sondon."},{"start":211.72,"end":213.519,"text":"Let's go to Satzbau"},{"start":213.519,"end":215.68,"text":"Sentence structure."},{"start":215.68,"end":218.4,"text":"Another example. Er ist nicht dumm, sondern"},{"start":218.4,"end":220.2,"text":"Er ist extrem"},{"start":220.2,"end":221.68,"text":"Faul."},{"start":221.68,"end":223.48,"text":"Er ist nicht dumm,"},{"start":223.48,"end":227.799,"text":"Sondern er ist extrem faul oder sondern"},{"start":227.799,"end":230.019,"text":"Extrem faul."},{"start":230.04,"end":231.12,"text":"Not stupid"},{"start":231.12,"end":232.939,"text":"But he"},{"start":233.64,"end":235.14,"text":"Lazy."},{"start":235.36,"end":238.7,"text":"Again, first part is Hauptsat."},{"start":238.72,"end":242.28,"text":"The first sentence is a main clause. Er ist nicht dumm."},{"start":242.28,"end":243.72,"text":"Conjugated verbond"},{"start":243.72,"end":245.799,"text":"Position perfect."},{"start":245.799,"end":247.239,"text":"And sondern"},{"start":247.239,"end":248.319,"text":"Introduces"},{"start":248.319,"end":252.36,"text":"Also in most situations also a main clause."},{"start":252.36,"end":254.42,"text":"Es ist eine Hauptsatzkonjunktion"},{"start":254.56,"end":258.479,"text":"Sondern ist main clause conjunction. So for the vast majority"},{"start":258.479,"end":260.84,"text":"Of situations when you will use this sondern"},{"start":260.84,"end":264.36,"text":"You will have two main classes zwei Hauptsätze"},{"start":264.36,"end":266.08,"text":"But you can actually use this sond"},{"start":266.08,"end":270.24,"text":"Also with like not complete classes just with adjectives"},{"start":270.24,"end":272.44,"text":"Or with nouns"},{"start":272.44,"end":276.08,"text":"But important and is always the case"},{"start":276.08,"end":278.88,"text":"You will always have ama"},{"start":278.88,"end":280.36,"text":"Before"},{"start":280.36,"end":281.44,"text":"Always"},{"start":281.44,"end":282.94,"text":"Before"},{"start":284.32,"end":286.62,"text":"Position null"},{"start":295,"end":299.74,"text":"Position null because a subject and ist"},{"start":300.56,"end":304.639,"text":"Where the conjugated verbs in a main clause it has to be on second"},{"start":304.639,"end":306.139,"text":"Position"},{"start":307.12,"end":310.12,"text":"Doesn't count as a position"},{"start":310.12,"end":313.759,"text":"You should know already other conjunctions which also"},{"start":313.759,"end":315.78,"text":"Position null"},{"start":316.52,"end":319.68,"text":"Und oder aber und den"},{"start":319.68,"end":322.46,"text":"And sondern all"},{"start":323.08,"end":324.96,"text":"Null Konjunktionen"},{"start":324.96,"end":326.12,"text":"Means"},{"start":326.12,"end":327.62,"text":"Count"},{"start":330,"end":331.96,"text":"Er ist in brackets"},{"start":331.96,"end":334.639,"text":"First sentence er ist nicht dumm und"},{"start":334.639,"end":337.819,"text":"Sondern er ist extrem faul"},{"start":338.039,"end":340.52,"text":"Is kind of the 100%"},{"start":340.52,"end":343.4,"text":"Correct version where you have the subject"},{"start":343.4,"end":347.919,"text":"And the verb in each sentence part in each main claus"},{"start":347.919,"end":351.88,"text":"But because it is the same in the first and in the second main"},{"start":351.88,"end":355.88,"text":"Clause er ist you can actually drop it which means you"},{"start":355.88,"end":359.039,"text":"We would rather just say er ist nicht dumm"},{"start":359.039,"end":361.52,"text":"Sondern extrem faul"},{"start":361.52,"end":364.28,"text":"So we drop the air and ist"},{"start":364.28,"end":366.56,"text":"In the second part in the sonder"},{"start":366.56,"end":367.599,"text":"Part"},{"start":367.599,"end":370.479,"text":"Because it is exactly the same subject"},{"start":370.479,"end":373.84,"text":"And exactly the same verb as in the first"},{"start":373.84,"end":375.08,"text":"Class."},{"start":375.08,"end":376.84,"text":"Anderes Beispiel:"},{"start":376.84,"end":380.68,"text":"Wir mieten kein Auto, sondern wir kaufen"},{"start":380.68,"end":382.58,"text":"Zwei E-Bikes."},{"start":382.8,"end":385.12,"text":"Wir mi kein Auto,"},{"start":385.12,"end":388.539,"text":"Sondern wir kaufen zwei E-Bikes."},{"start":388.56,"end":391.16,"text":"We ar renting a car,"},{"start":391.16,"end":392.759,"text":"But rather"},{"start":392.759,"end":395.16,"text":"Buying two e-bikes."},{"start":395.16,"end":397.62,"text":"Ebikes are e-bikes."},{"start":397.72,"end":401.24,"text":"You can also have the German version, which ist Elektrorad"},{"start":401.24,"end":403.06,"text":"Oder Elektrofahrad."},{"start":403.96,"end":405.96,"text":"Kind of a long"},{"start":405.96,"end":408.759,"text":"Name, but EB is actually 100%"},{"start":408.759,"end":413.039,"text":"Correct and ist accepted in Duden and everywhere."},{"start":413.039,"end":416.16,"text":"So easier version is just ebikes."},{"start":416.16,"end":419.039,"text":"And as before, we haben zwei Hauptsätze"},{"start":419.039,"end":420.84,"text":"We have two main classes"},{"start":420.84,"end":424.4,"text":"And again we have Sondern in Position"},{"start":424.4,"end":425.72,"text":"0."},{"start":425.72,"end":429.84,"text":"Wir in Position 1 und kaufen das konjugierte"},{"start":429.84,"end":431.68,"text":"Verb in Position"},{"start":431.68,"end":433.18,"text":"2."},{"start":433.4,"end":435.479,"text":"And then we have here"},{"start":435.479,"end":437.96,"text":"Mieten und kaufen. So we have"},{"start":437.96,"end":440.199,"text":"Which is the subject in [räuspern] both"},{"start":440.199,"end":443.68,"text":"Classes the same subject but we have two different verbs."},{"start":443.68,"end":445.84,"text":"We have meeten und kaufen."},{"start":445.84,"end":447,"text":"Means"},{"start":447,"end":449.099,"text":"Only drop"},{"start":449.12,"end":450.24,"text":"Information"},{"start":450.24,"end":451.28,"text":"Exactly"},{"start":451.28,"end":454.44,"text":"In both parts which is here wir"},{"start":454.44,"end":457.08,"text":"Rather say wir mieten kein Auto sondern"},{"start":457.08,"end":459.639,"text":"Kaufen zwei E-Bikes"},{"start":459.639,"end":462.02,"text":"Ohne wir"},{"start":462.24,"end":465.12,"text":"Machen wir weitere Beispiele. Let's do some more"},{"start":465.12,"end":466.319,"text":"Examples."},{"start":466.319,"end":468.72,"text":"Juan kommt nicht aus Spanien,"},{"start":468.72,"end":471.06,"text":"Sondern aus Argentinien."},{"start":471.24,"end":473.879,"text":"Juan kommt nicht aus Spanien,"},{"start":473.879,"end":476.159,"text":"Sondern aus Argentinien."},{"start":476.159,"end":479.78,"text":"Juan ist not from Spain, but from Argentina."},{"start":480.56,"end":483.159,"text":"Ich habe heute keine Zeit,"},{"start":483.159,"end":485.319,"text":"Sondern erst morgen."},{"start":485.319,"end":487.72,"text":"Ich habe heute keine Zeit,"},{"start":487.72,"end":491.4,"text":"Sondern erst morgen. I don't have time today."},{"start":491.4,"end":494.319,"text":"I will be available tomorrow. Or literally,"},{"start":494.319,"end":496.979,"text":"But only tomorrow."},{"start":498.319,"end":500.72,"text":"Erst here the meaning of er also"},{"start":500.72,"end":506.78,"text":"Video erst oder schon difference between those two also linked down in the description"},{"start":507.039,"end":509.12,"text":"Das Auto ist nicht schwarz"},{"start":509.12,"end":511,"text":"Sondern dunkelblau."},{"start":511,"end":514.64,"text":"Das Auto ist nicht schwarz sondern dunkelblau."},{"start":514.64,"end":517.8,"text":"The car isn't black but dark blue."},{"start":517.8,"end":518.839,"text":"Dunkelblau."},{"start":518.839,"end":521.32,"text":"Dark blue. Which ist almost"},{"start":521.32,"end":522.82,"text":"Schwarz."},{"start":523.039,"end":525.92,"text":"Wir haben den Urlaub nicht storniert,"},{"start":525.92,"end":528.58,"text":"Sondern nur verschoben."},{"start":529.08,"end":532.16,"text":"Wir haben den Urlaub nicht stiert, sondern"},{"start":532.16,"end":533.8,"text":"Nur verschoben."},{"start":533.8,"end":535.839,"text":"Stornieren ist to"},{"start":535.839,"end":539.079,"text":"Something. So, we cancel the vacation."},{"start":539.079,"end":542.6,"text":"We just postponed it. Verschieben, etwas verschieben"},{"start":542.6,"end":544.16,"text":"Ist to postpone"},{"start":544.16,"end":545.66,"text":"Something."},{"start":545.8,"end":548,"text":"Small side note. You see in the first"},{"start":548,"end":551.279,"text":"Main clause, wir haben den Urlaub nicht stiert."},{"start":551.279,"end":554.26,"text":"Das ist in perfect, in presente."},{"start":554.839,"end":558.36,"text":"Means sondern part also always"},{"start":558.36,"end":560.26,"text":"Tense as"},{"start":560.48,"end":562.16,"text":"Main class."},{"start":562.16,"end":563.6,"text":"And because"},{"start":563.6,"end":567.399,"text":"Also a verb with perfect mit haben"},{"start":567.399,"end":570.88,"text":"Verschoben haben, we cancel or we can drop"},{"start":570.88,"end":575.24,"text":"This haben. So, wir haben den Urlaub nicht stiert,"},{"start":575.24,"end":576.44,"text":"Sondern"},{"start":576.44,"end":579.76,"text":"Wir haben in brackets this you can drop because the same as in the"},{"start":579.76,"end":585.06,"text":"First main class, nur verschoben, sondern nur verschoben."},{"start":585.8,"end":589.68,"text":"Anderes Beispiel: Lisa trinkt nie Kaffee, sondern"},{"start":589.68,"end":591.86,"text":"Immer nur Tee."},{"start":592.279,"end":595.519,"text":"H we have an example with nie. Lisa trinkt nie Kaffee,"},{"start":595.519,"end":598.44,"text":"Sondern immer nur Tee. Lisa never drinks coffee."},{"start":598.44,"end":601.72,"text":"She always drinks only tea."},{"start":601.72,"end":605.48,"text":"Oder wir fahren im Urlaub nie ans Meer,"},{"start":605.48,"end":607.16,"text":"Sondern meistens"},{"start":607.16,"end":609.279,"text":"In die Berge."},{"start":609.279,"end":612.8,"text":"Wir fahren im Urlaub nie ans Meer,"},{"start":612.8,"end":615.76,"text":"Sondern meistens in die Berge."},{"start":615.76,"end":617.44,"text":"We never go to the beach and vacation"},{"start":617.44,"end":618.56,"text":"Instead."},{"start":618.56,"end":620.04,"text":"We have an example"},{"start":620.04,"end":623.92,"text":"Which is more like with instead or but rather."},{"start":623.92,"end":626.88,"text":"We usually go to the mountains."},{"start":626.88,"end":630.64,"text":"Und ein Beispiel mit niemand. Ich habe niemanden"},{"start":630.64,"end":632.12,"text":"Gesehen,"},{"start":632.12,"end":635.36,"text":"Sondern nur eine laute Stimme gehört."},{"start":635.36,"end":639.279,"text":"Ich habe niemanden gesehen, sondern nur eine laute Stimme"},{"start":639.279,"end":640.519,"text":"Gehört."},{"start":640.519,"end":642.2,"text":"I didn't see anyone,"},{"start":642.2,"end":645.62,"text":"But I did hear a loud voice."},{"start":646.12,"end":649.92,"text":"Now, hier das niemanden ist not B1 level."},{"start":649.92,"end":654.399,"text":"Indefinit pronomen which is usually introduced in B2 level."},{"start":654.399,"end":656.32,"text":"We have a video about as well."},{"start":656.32,"end":659.6,"text":"Will will link it at the end of this video which is very"},{"start":659.6,"end":660.839,"text":"Soon."},{"start":660.839,"end":663.92,"text":"Er hat mit niemandem darüber gesprochen,"},{"start":663.92,"end":667.839,"text":"Sondern das Geheimnis für sich behalten."},{"start":667.839,"end":669.839,"text":"Er hat mit niemandem"},{"start":669.839,"end":671.44,"text":"Darüber gesprochen,"},{"start":671.44,"end":674.6,"text":"Sondern das Geheimnis für sich behalten."},{"start":674.6,"end":678,"text":"Ein schwieriger Satz. He didn't talk to anyone about it,"},{"start":678,"end":682.399,"text":"But instead he kept the secret to himself."},{"start":682.399,"end":685.76,"text":"Für sich behalten. Etwas für sich behalten"},{"start":685.76,"end":687.959,"text":"Ist to keep something"},{"start":687.959,"end":690.06,"text":"To yourself."},{"start":691.079,"end":692.56,"text":"Bonest"},{"start":692.56,"end":694.8,"text":"A very short one but an important"},{"start":694.8,"end":696.6,"text":"One common question"},{"start":696.6,"end":699,"text":"Sonden und because"},{"start":699,"end":702.899,"text":"Translate to spot when to use which"},{"start":703.12,"end":707.2,"text":"In general you can actually use both in a lot of situations"},{"start":707.2,"end":709.56,"text":"But to make it simple"},{"start":709.56,"end":713.399,"text":"Is used for a correction when you want to correct something in the same"},{"start":713.399,"end":716.079,"text":"Clause or as an alternative"},{"start":716.079,"end":719.459,"text":"So not that but rather"},{"start":731.48,"end":732.98,"text":"Worksation"},{"start":735.279,"end":737.38,"text":"Nicht oder kein."},{"start":746.959,"end":748.44,"text":"Correction"},{"start":748.44,"end":749.94,"text":"Use"},{"start":750.399,"end":752.079,"text":"Other situations"},{"start":752.079,"end":753.579,"text":"Use"},{"start":754.32,"end":757.639,"text":"And if you want to know about sondern as a twopart"},{"start":757.639,"end":762.72,"text":"Conjunction nicht nur sondern auch denn das Video hier ist for you or mention"},{"start":762.72,"end":766.24,"text":"Before indefinit pronomen ein B2"},{"start":766.24,"end":770.699,"text":"I hope you learn something Bis zum nächsten Mal. Tschüss und bye bye."}],"auto":true}